Package: ytdownload
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: bash, tovinci
Recommends: yt-dlp, ffmpeg
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: yt-dlp wrapper with mp4, mp3, mov and wav output
 ytdownload downloads video or audio with yt-dlp at the best resolution
 and can convert the result to MOV or WAV using tovinci.
